        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14966\">PR #14966</a> from <code>xia-chao:wasi-write-permit-4streams</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The stdio, sink, file and C API output streams did not enforce the check-write permit: writes larger than the reported permit were accepted instead of trapping. Make these four streams trap when a write exceeds the permit, as wasi:io requires.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
